@host = http://localhost:5080

### Case 1 (expected COMPLIES)
POST {{host}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "Closed ticket #48219 and sent confirmation email",
  "guideline": "All closed tickets must include a confirmation email"
}

### Case 2 (expected DEVIATES)
POST {{host}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "Closed ticket #48219 without sending confirmation email",
  "guideline": "All closed tickets must include a confirmation email"
}

### Case 3 (expected DEVIATES)
POST {{host}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "Rebooted the server and checked logs",
  "guideline": "Servers must be rebooted weekly and logs reviewed after restart"
}

### Case 4 (expected UNCLEAR)
POST {{host}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "Skipped torque confirmation at Station 3",
  "guideline": "No guidelines exist for this case."
}

### Invalid input (expected 400 ValidationProblemDetails)
POST {{host}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "   "
}

### History, newest first (limit 1-200, default 50)
GET {{host}}/history

### History, paged and filtered
GET {{host}}/history?limit=10&offset=0&result=DEVIATES

### Summary
GET {{host}}/summary
